are reducing full year guidance for adjusted operating expenses to $585 million to $615 million implying full year 2019 realized gross synergies of $146 million based on the midpoint of that guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2019 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2019-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Fannon","x":"So Joe, I just want to talk about expenses and flexibility obviously reduced guidance this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2019 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2019-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rich Repetto","x":"Is this a pass through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2019 Q4","e":"virt","d":"2020-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"During the year, we, around 10% of that pass through the Virtu pipes either on a screen or through an RFQ system and whatnot.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q1","e":"virt","d":"2020-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"So we call everything V something else, so VFX, which is direct streaming of FX, VFI, direct streaming of treasuries and fixed income products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q1","e":"virt","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"Furthermore, we have made a commitment to our employees that no broad-based layoffs will be initiated this year, and we will continue to offer support as individuals face the implications of this crisis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q1","e":"virt","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"Our longer-term strategy of acquiring large financial service firms adjacent to the Virtu core business, streamlining and enhancing them technologically and operationally from the inside, was again validated in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q1","e":"virt","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"So of the increased guidance, Dan, you'll see we accrued a lot of it already in the first quarter, and that was really reflecting the larger anticipated headcount because of our commitment to our employees, number.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"And so as a result, we didn't have we haven't had any material market data or connectivity, price increases in the last two years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rich Repetto","x":"It would tell me that I know there's some pass-through payments, but it would tell me that it's a big opportunity for revenue there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"We remain committed to our decision, given the COVID crisis, that we will have no specific reductions in force as we continue to support our people,during these trying times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Molluso","x":"As noted previously, we have put on hold any dramatic expense reductions this year, including any reductions in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Kramm","x":"I guess the reason why I ask is, you mentioned earlier that there is still some synergies to go through, I think a lot of that is the -- I guess the layoffs that you -- that you didn't do this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Kramm","x":"So is this one of those situations where January 1st those layoffs happen and then the cost base is fully reset or is it going to be a process over 2021?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIRT 2020 Q4","e":"virt","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"I'm particularly proud that we maintained our discipline around costs even in a year where we paused some merger-related cost reduction efforts, and we were able to achieve an impressive 73% percent adjusted EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIRT 2021 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Douglas Cifu","x":"We are also in the early stages of developing our ability to stream cryptocurrencies over our direct-to-dealer streaming liquidity platform, VFX.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/virtu-financial-inc-virt-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Douglas A. Cifu","x":"…outstanding results across our businesses in the second quarter, fueled by market turmoil around tariffs, economic policy and general volatility we recorded $568 million in adjusted net trading income, which is $9.2 million per day and $1.53 in adjusted EPS, both numbers recent highs and are…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-virt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q2","e":"virt","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Douglas A. Cifu","x":"In ETF block, the volumes and volatility surrounding Liberation Day and the ongoing tariff news drove elevated client demand for our ETF desk, we continue to grow our market share and client list globally for ETFs, and we remain focused on the build-out of our Europe ETF block offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-virt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Brenton L. Saunders","x":"Singles' Day is a very big event for us with our DTC approach in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-financial-virt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Osama Eldessouky","x":"Finally, a brief word on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-financial-virt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Osama Eldessouky","x":"The tariff policy remains fluid, and we are continuing to monitor updates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-financial-virt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2025 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brenton L. Saunders","x":"So it's not really about just cost cutting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/virtu-financial-virt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2026 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aaron Simons","x":"I think it's just much more visible now and the dollar amounts are higher because of the AI spend that people are doing, and there's a bit of a price difference just because of supply chain constraints and other things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/virtu-virt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIRT 2026 Q3","e":"virt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Kenneth Worthington","x":"And for the follow-up, how would you characterize the investment that the industry is making in new technologies like AI and other?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/virtu-virt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,8765,0,0,0,7683,790],[37,1,7608,0,0,0,6618,682],[38,1,9943,0,0,0,7999,1555],[39,1,10188,0,0,0,8375,1448],[40,1,10091,0,0,0,8882,909],[41,1,10328,0,0,0,8773,1213],[42,1,10821,0,0,0,9001,1468],[43,1,10470,0,0,0,8178,1876],[44,1,11460,0,0,0,9358,1724],[45,1,7427,0,0,0,6413,753],[46,1,10685,0,0,0,9048,1303],[47,1,7912,0,0,0,6262,1350],[62,1,7748,0,0,0,6234,992],[63,1,8314,0,0,0,2600,5318],[64,1,2973,0,0,0,1943,557],[65,1,4804,0,0,0,3326,448],[66,1,2922,0,0,0,1772,973],[67,1,2972,0,0,0,1997,803]],"cinema":[[36,1,8765,0,0,0,7683,790],[37,1,7608,0,0,0,6618,682],[38,1,9943,0,0,0,7999,1555],[39,1,10188,0,0,0,8375,1448],[40,1,10091,0,0,0,8882,909],[41,1,10328,0,0,0,8773,1213],[42,1,10821,0,0,0,9001,1468],[43,1,10470,0,0,0,8178,1876],[44,1,11460,0,0,0,9358,1724],[45,1,7427,0,0,0,6413,753],[46,1,10685,0,0,0,9048,1303],[47,1,7912,0,0,0,6262,1350],[62,1,7748,0,0,0,6234,992],[63,1,8314,0,0,0,2600,5318],[64,1,2973,0,0,0,1943,557],[65,1,4804,0,0,0,3326,448],[66,1,2922,0,0,0,1772,973],